OL,3,GNEWSAThird Heathrow runway should only
OL,4,Ago ahead if airlines pay for cleaner
OL,5,Aflying, say advisers
OL,6,
OL,7,FOnce built, the expanded airport would
OL,8,Fproduce more carbon dioxide than any
OL,9,Fother single sector of the economy by
OL,10,F2050. Heathrow said expansion and
OL,11,Fclimate goals were "not a choice" and
OL,12,Fit would deliver both.
